You have more than enough to ascend, though you are going to have to
worry about that AC a little bit...  Ditch your garbage leather helm
ASAP and put on something (anything) better.  Dragon scales don't need
fooproofing, so you don't need to worry about that.  It would help if
you have gold detection handy or some other way to find the portals in
the Planes, but you may already.  Charging the wand of poly is certainly
a way to cycle through armor or tools, but don't hold your breath --
though admittedly, you have little other use for the scroll of charging
at this point.

I figure just geno L or h (either is a noticeably more obnoxious problem
to deal with when you aren't using the infinite Elbereth from
Magicbane), and pick up whatever you can along the way down; there's a
lot of loot in Gehennom just lying around, and certainly more scrolls of
enchant armor, if nothing else, which can be used to take care of your
AC.  (Detect Treasure at Expert is your friend; even only at Skilled,
it's a well-thought-of acquaintance.)

